{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>To be swept away.</b> From the same root as בגלל הדבר (Deuteronomy 15:10) [\"on account of the matter\"]." "<b>And to fall upon</b> — like a man who falls of his own accord upon another, and says to him: \"You have made me fall.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra reads להתגולל as derived from the root גלל, same as בגלל; the gloss clarifies the lexical connection he draws."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:57.527009029Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}